# Where these should be placed?

1. httpreq -> Raspberry Pi
2. main -> Render
3. serverless-poll -> systemd service (Keep parent directory as "REST" or change paths in the file)
4. .env -> Render AND Raspberry Pi
5. requirements -> Render AND Raspberry Pi

# Steps
1. Calling -
```bash
curl -s -X POST https://restproject-h1uq.onrender.com/gas | jq
```
/temphum for temp and humidity
/gas for gas

Outputs in json.